  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BRCiS - Humanitarian Assistance and Resilience Building in Somalia (HARBS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To avert increased use of negative coping strategies, and rising morbidity and mortality rates, BRCiS will scale up its existing humanitarian response to the ongoing drought in Somalia. This response will ensure that vulnerable households are able to meet their basic needs and withstand the impacts of the drought and strengthen their capacity for when there is an opportunity to recover. The project will target communities in districts that are most affected by the drought, identified through the FSNAU projections, displacement data, and the established BRCiS Real Time Risk Monitoring.</narrative>
  </description>
